Daily Pokémon Guess (apps/pokeguess)

Game (game.js, index.html, data/, imgs/)
  Squirdle, a Pokémon Wordle-like by Sergio "Fireblend" Esquivel
  (https://squirdle.fireblend.com).
  License: Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).
  Source: https://github.com/Fireblend/squirdle, commit
  814febcdc516894b24f6e98559bbb12eb4f40029.
  The Pokémon data (data/pokedex.json) is based on Mario Tormo Romero's
  Complete Pokémon Dataset on Kaggle, as Squirdle's README says. The name
  lists (data/de.json, fr.json, ja.json, ko.json) and the hint pictures
  (imgs/) are Squirdle's, unchanged.

  This is a modified version. game.js and index.html are a rewrite of
  Squirdle's pages and scripts (index.html, daily.html, filters.html,
  scripts/*.js, style.css) for a car's touch screen; the rules, hints,
  attribute filters, streak titles and type colours are Squirdle's. The
  changes: one page with Daily and Free play; the Daily Pokémon comes from
  the date (a fixed shuffle of the Pokémon in their usual form, a new one
  each local day from 29 October 2026) instead of Squirdle's daily.json;
  progress is kept in localStorage instead of cookies; tapping a
  suggestion makes the guess; each guess shows its generation, types and
  size; a guess can't be repeated; results are shared by QR code to a
  phone page (share.html) instead of the clipboard; jQuery and the Telex
  web font are gone.

